00:00:59,851 --> 00:01:05,471
A long, long ago in a land far, far away

3
00:01:05,971 --> 00:01:14,671
lived Polka, a beautiful maiden who drew the ire of her queen for she too wished to be the prettiest being in the world.

4
00:01:23,701 --> 00:01:28,451
One day, Polka was walking through the forest when she met an old woman.

5
00:01:33,861 --> 00:01:38,991
"Would you like an apple? My, but these are ripe and tasty," she said.

6
00:01:39,991 --> 00:01:42,871
Tempted by the offer, Polka gladly took a bite.

7
00:01:57,651 --> 00:02:02,831
As Polka was spellbound by how delicious the apple was, the old woman vanished.

8
00:02:03,951 --> 00:02:08,571
It was then that Polka made the realization: the Apple was poisoned.

9
00:02:19,461 --> 00:02:24,071
But it was too late. Polka collapsed to the ground helplessly.

10
00:02:58,331 --> 00:03:00,671
Many moons later, the fateful moment had arrived.

11
00:03:02,731 --> 00:03:04,621
A prince had appeared before Polka.

12
00:03:26,171 --> 00:03:30,931
He was captivated by her beauty and eventually gave her the kiss of fate...

13
00:03:31,951 --> 00:03:35,391
And Polka awakened, ever so beautiful!

14
00:03:37,781 --> 00:03:45,311
Her beauty had not diminished over time, as though reality was but a virtual concept to her...

15
00:03:47,781 --> 00:03:53,331
Hm? But wait, Polka is a virtual idol, so poisoned apples won't work on her.

16
00:03:54,231 --> 00:03:57,341
But don't get me wrong, Polka-senpai is incredibly pretty!

17
